sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant GA as GitHub Actions daily.yml
  participant PR as prepare.py
  participant API as GitHub API
  participant UP as Upstream repository
  participant INV as dist/candidate.json
  GA->>PR: run with the job token
  PR->>API: GET commits/HEAD
  API-->>PR: commit sha (pinned for this run)
  PR->>API: GET license
  API-->>PR: SPDX id and LICENSE text
  PR->>API: GET tarball at that sha
  API->>UP: snapshot of that commit
  UP-->>PR: tar.gz (max 90 MB)
  PR->>PR: safe extraction, keep .yar and .yara under allowed paths
  PR->>PR: reject over 1 MB or NUL bytes, SHA-256 of each file
  PR->>INV: sources with commit and licence check, files with path sha256 bytes
